{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RAD CTRL is a chill VR multiplayer game featuring realistic RC car physics in fun environments. Realistic physics recreates the challenge and fun of driving RC cars around any environment. Hangout with your friends, or meet new ones, with the best light-competitive VR multiplayer racer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against your friends to compete for who the best RC racer is! Up to 8 players in a race match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic RC car physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique race tracks and environments - some realistic and some outlandish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different types of RC cars so you can find one that fits your own racing style and preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customize your own character avatar</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579250?t=1743358796","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579250?t=1743358796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579250/80858035cee1f801c0d0e9aa7fe51585a5e452b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743358796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579250/80858035cee1f801c0d0e9aa7fe51585a5e452b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743358796","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RAD CTRL is a chill VR multiplayer game featuring realistic RC car physics in fun environments. Realist